  m_text: 'Cut Ingredient Particle System and SFX


    When the player hits the
    ingredient with the knife while it is on the cutting board, particles representing
    chunks fall off. Particle texture changes based on which ingredient is being
    cut.

    Knife cut SFX were recorded while I was making pizza and normalised
    in audacity. Squelch and ingredient preparation completed noise were sourced
    externally.'
