  m_text: 'Water Vertex Shader + Bubble PS


    Water vertex shader to be used in
    the sink. Functionality of washing ingredients to be implemented alongside other
    vertical slices. When the player places a dirty ingredient in the water, bubble
    particle effects will rise from the water for feedback to show the dirty ingredient
    is being cleaned.'
