  m_text: 'As a newly-hired kitchen hand, locate and prep all the ingredients to
    placate the Chef in the kitchen. Get to know your limited workspace as you learn
    where each ingredient is kept, and prepare them exactly as the Chef asks you
    to. In Pantry Panic players receive an order from Chef, who tasks the players
    with preparing a variety of ingredients for them before the player throws the
    ingredient to Chef through the window. A single play session should take the
    player no more than 5 minutes.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
