  m_text: 'Player has a tool belt that is attached at the waist. Tool belt contains
    two holders for important items the player will need throughout gameplay: a knife
    and orders PDA. If player drops the knife or PDA on the ground or throws them
    in an inaccessible location, it teleports back to the belt. The belt has an accessibility
    feature where it adjusts to player height based on camera height in the scene.'
